# kosha-ontology-v3 restructure patch (Phase E Step 4b)
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix core: <https://cashtoss.info/ontology#> .

# fix for 2 target=https://cashtoss.info/ontology/penalty#CriminalSanction
https://cashtoss.info/ontology/penalty#CriminalSanction rdfs:subClassOf https://cashtoss.info/ontology/penalty#CriminalSanctionType .

# fix for 5 target=https://cashtoss.info/ontology/risk/agent#HazardousAgent
https://cashtoss.info/ontology/risk/agent#HazardousAgent rdfs:subClassOf https://cashtoss.info/ontology/risk#HazardousAgentFeature .
https://cashtoss.info/ontology/risk#HazardousAgentFeature rdfs:subClassOf https://cashtoss.info/ontology/risk#RiskFeature .
